  {
    "id": 3005003020230,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "見て見て、これどうかな？",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "se": "0152",
    "voice": "produce_events/300500302/3005003020230"
  },
  {
    "id": 3005003020240,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "いい感じで、似合ってるよー\r\n可愛いと思うー",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300500302/3005003020240"
  },
  {
    "id": 3005003020250,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "やーった！　まみみんのお墨付き！",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300500302/3005003020250"
  },
  {
    "id": 3005003020260,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "あれー？　\r\nでもー、お互いにコーディネートするんじゃないのー？",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300500302/3005003020260"
  },
  {
    "id": 3005003020270,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "三峰、自分で服着ちゃってるしー",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300500302/3005003020270"
  },
  {
    "id": 3005003020280,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "いやぁごめん、我慢できなくってさぁ\r\n三峰の素敵な服アンテナが反応しちゃったんだよ！",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300500302/3005003020280"
  },
  {
    "id": 3005003020290,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "……それじゃあ、しょーがないかもー？",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300500302/3005003020290"
  },
  {
    "id": 3005003020300,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "ついでにまみみんも何か着てみる？",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300500302/3005003020300"
  },
  {
    "id": 3005003020310,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "そうだねー三峰も着てるし、\r\n私も着てみよーかなぁ",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300500302/3005003020310"
  },
  {
    "id": 3005003020320,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "おっけおっけ！\r\n三峰のおすすめはね……んーっと……",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300500302/3005003020320"
  },
  {
    "id": 3005003020330,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "あ、ほらっ、これとか、これもおすすめ！\r\nあとこっちも気に入ってるんだ～！",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "se": "0152",
    "voice": "produce_events/300500302/3005003020330"
  },
  {
    "id": 3005003020340,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "へー、面白い服だねー\r\nあ、これに私の服合わせたら、もっと面白くなりそー",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300500302/3005003020340"
  },
  {
    "id": 3005003020350,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "わかる！　楽しそう！\r\nどっちの服も混ぜて自由にコーデしちゃおうよ！",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300500302/3005003020350"
  },
